Subject: [PATCH] Document doc bisect

doc/README.md gains a Bisect section: how it searches and probes,
dependencies (--link, --setup, suggestions), the result, the
explanation, the restore offer, --json and a real six-turn run.
AGENTS.md records the boundary (tests exports, never the working copy);
CHANGELOG and STATUS.md are updated, and Next is natural-language
restore.

